③⑤⑥⑨⑩\n（5点）\n・枠連\n⑦④（横山枠連）\n（1点）\n・複勝\n③\n（1点）"},{"caption":"星谷美緒：","body":"今回はうまらじメンバー全員でお送りしました！\nうまらじでMCの皆さん、スタッフさん、リスナーさんたちと\n予想する時間がとても好きだったので寂しいですが\nいつか復活することを祈っています！！\n有馬記念たのしみーーー！！！\n\n【予想】\n・三連単軸2頭マルチ\n⑨⑬-③⑥⑩\n（18点）\n・複勝\n⑫\n（1点）"},{"caption":"＜スタッフ予想＞","body":"構成作家：\n【予想】\n・単勝\n③\n（1点）\n・複勝\n③\n（1点）\n・馬連\n③-⑨⑬\n（2点）\n・ワイド\n③-⑨⑬\n（2点）\n\nディレクター：\n【予想】\n・三連単フォーメーション\n⑨⑬⇒③⑥⑬⇒①⑤⑥⑩⑫\n（23点）\n\nプロデューサー：\n【予想】\n・三連単フォーメーション\n⑤⑦⑩⇒⑨⇒全\n⑤⑦⑩⇒全⇒⑨\n⑨⑬⇒⑤⑦⑩⇒全\n⑨⑬⇒全⇒⑤⑦⑩\n⑤⑦⑩⇒⑤⑦⑩⇒全\n⑤⑦⑩⇒全⇒⑤⑦⑩\n⑨⑬⇒全⇒⑨⑬\n③⇒①⇒⑦\n①⇒②⇒⑧\n（450点）"}],"additional_announcements":[],"update_images":[{"caption":null,"link_url":null,"image":{"url":"https://d3bzklg4lms4gh.cloudfront.net/update_image/image/default/production/75/e9/349b05988e2a48bc30cde4a5eb94a4eb6006/image?v=1671851328"},"extensible":true}]},"personality_groups":[{"title":"メインパーソナリティ","image":{"url":null},"id":345,"role_of_performers":[{"role_name":null,"profile_image":{"url":"https://d3bzklg4lms4gh.cloudfront.net/role_of_performer_version/profile_image/default/production/d9/ce/470344bebe4553e4c140b50bfa619c7a3944/image?v=1632824775"},"introduction":null,"role_of_performer_free_fields":[],"name":"浅野真澄","twitter_id":"masumi_asano","instagram_id":"asano.masumi","birthday":"8月25日","office":null,"performer_id":99,"allow_like":true},{"role_name":null,"profile_image":{"url":"https://d3bzklg4lms4gh.cloudfront.net/role_of_performer_version/profile_image/default/production/15/d5/0a198429fe05d3fceb6e0d8071eabe456f86/image?v=1632824854"},"introduction":null,"role_of_performer_free_fields":[],"name":"上村源","twitter_id":"kamimura_minato","instagram_id":null,"birthday":"11月24日","office":"スターダストプロモーション","performer_id":1772,"allow_like":true}]},{"title":"マンスリーパーソナリティ（入れ替わり）","image":{"url":null},"id":346,"role_of_performers":[{"role_name":null,"profile_image":{"url":"https://d3bzklg4lms4gh.cloudfront.net/role_of_performer_version/profile_image/default/production/f3/06/600f11c605350c0cd690c3d83143f4633ed1/image?v=1632824896"},"introduction":null,"role_of_p